03588 {\cf18 void} ImGui::RenderTextClipped({\cf17 const} ImVec2& pos_min, {\cf17 const} ImVec2& pos_max, {\cf17 const} {\cf18 char}* text, {\cf17 const} {\cf18 char}* text_end, {\cf17 const} ImVec2* text_size_if_known, {\cf17 const} ImVec2& align, {\cf17 const} ImRect* clip_rect)\par
