17225 \par
17226     {\cf20 // - Setup central node pointers}\par
17227     {\cf20 // - Find if there's only a single visible window in the hierarchy (in which case we need to display a regular title bar -> FIXME-DOCK: that last part is not done yet!)}\par
17228     {\cf20 // Cannot merge this with DockNodeUpdateFlagsAndCollapse() because FirstNodeWithWindows is found after window removal and child collapsing}\par
