17237     {\cf20 // Copy the window class from of our first window so it can be used for proper dock filtering.}\par
17238     {\cf20 // When node has mixed windows, prioritize the class with the most constraint (DockingAllowUnclassed = false) as the reference to copy.}\par
17239     {\cf20 // FIXME-DOCK: We don't recurse properly, this code could be reworked to work from DockNodeUpdateScanRec.}\par
